## Default behavior

On **any substantive question** about this project — anything that involves prior decisions, conventions, entities, or accumulated context — your first action is:

1. Read `vault/index.md` (the catalog of every page in this vault).
2. Read the specific pages the index points you to (under `vault/<category>/`).
3. Only fall back to grepping `raw/` or the surrounding repo when the vault is silent.

