## Read order

1. **`CLAUDE.md`** (this file) — schema, operational notes, conventions
2. **`vault/index.md`** — catalog of every page, grouped by category
3. **`vault/log.md`** — recent ingests, queries, lints, decisions (the last ~20 entries are usually enough)
4. **`vault/<category>/<page>.md`** — the actual content
5. **`raw/<source>`** — original source documents, only when a page cites them

Stop once you have enough context. Reading the whole vault is rarely correct.

