## Skills

The vault ships with five skills under `.claude/skills/`:

- `ingest` — pull a new source into the vault
- `query` — answer a question using the vault, optionally file the answer back
- `lint` — periodic health check
- `capture-decision` — record a decision the moment it surfaces in conversation (fires PROACTIVELY)
- `file-back` — promote chat content into a vault page

See each skill's `SKILL.md` for the full workflow.

